sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as TrainerReconciler<br/>controller-manager
    participant Templates as Manifest Templates<br/>/opt/*-template
    participant WorkDir as Work Directory<br/>/opt/manifests-work
    participant KubeflowCtrl as Kubeflow Trainer<br/>Controller Manager
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant User as Data Scientist

    Note over Platform,K8sAPI: Operator Deployment Flow

    Platform->>K8sAPI: Create Trainer CR (default-trainer)<br/>components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event (For: Trainer)
    Controller->>Templates: Read embedded manifests
    Templates-->>Controller: Templates (manifests, runtimes, imagestreams)
    Controller->>WorkDir: Render templates with platform params
    WorkDir-->>Controller: Rendered manifests

    Note over Controller,K8sAPI: Apply Managed Resources

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update CRDs<br/>(TrainJob, TrainingRuntime, ClusterTrainingRuntime)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment<br/>(kubeflow-trainer-controller-manager)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update RBAC<br/>(ClusterRoles, ClusterRoleBindings)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Services<br/>(443→9443, 8080)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ValidatingWebhookConfigurations
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ImageStreams
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update PodMonitors

    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch events (secondary resources)<br/>Label: platform.opendatahub.io/part-of: trainer
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update Trainer CR status<br/>(condition-based health reporting)

    Note over User,Webhook: User Training Workflow

    User->>K8sAPI: Create TrainJob CR<br/>trainer.kubeflow.org/v1alpha1
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission review<br/>POST /validate-trainer-kubeflow-org-v1alpha1-trainjob<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission response (Allow/Deny)
    K8sAPI-->>User: TrainJob created/rejected

    KubeflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Watch TrainJob<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    KubeflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create JobSets<br/>(jobset.x-k8s.io)
    KubeflowCtrl->>K8sAPI: Update TrainJob status

    Note over Controller: Health & Monitoring

    Controller-->>Controller: /healthz :8081 (liveness)
    Controller-->>Controller: /readyz :8081 (readiness)
    Controller-->>Controller: /metrics :8080 (plaintext HTTP)
